# Optuna params
tuned_params/
tuned_params/*.json

# Development/Scratch
scratch/
 
# Scheduler lock file
*.lock
scheduler.lock

# Claude Code — machine-specific settings (interpreter paths, personal allowlist).
# .claude/settings.json, .claude/hooks/, .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/
# ARE committed: they are project truths, not personal preference.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.doctor-backup

# Generated model packages (LoRA export, probe embedding caches, the Kaggle
# series package) — regenerable from tools/export_*_package.py and
# tools/run_probe.py, and large.
*.npz

# Scored comparison output. The measurement itself belongs in experiment_runs
# and in the commit message that reports it, which is how every earlier result
# here was recorded; a JSON checked in beside them would be a second copy that
# can disagree with the first.
p2_*.json
baselines_*.json

# Serena MCP server's per-project cache and memories — machine-local, and it
# re-derives itself from the source tree on demand.
.serena/
news_relevance_sample.json
news_relevance_subsample_idx.json

# Evidence-Grading Redesign, Stage 0 — generated run artifacts.
# The out-of-sample cache is already covered by *.npz and the run log by *.log;
# these two are the report and the per-ticker table, regenerated by
# tools/run_evidence_grading.py. The findings live in docs/, not here.
stage0_report.txt
evidence_grades_v2.csv
